{"lang":"ur","rtl":true,"p":[["السلام علیکم","assalamu alaikum","अस्सलामु अलैकुम (आप पर सलामती हो)","Peace be upon you (hello)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["وعلیکم السلام","wa alaikum assalam","वअलैकुम अस्सलाम (जवाब में)","And upon you be peace (the reply)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["آداب","aadaab","आदाब (नमस्कार)","Greetings (a polite hello)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["خوش آمدید","khush aamdeed","ख़ुश आमदीद (स्वागत है)","Welcome","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["آپ کیسے ہیں؟","aap kaise hain?","आप कैसे हैं?","How are you? (to a man)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["آپ کیسی ہیں؟","aap kaisi hain?","आप कैसी हैं?","How are you? (to a woman)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["میں ٹھیک ہوں، شکریہ","main theek hoon, shukriya","मैं ठीक हूँ, शुक्रिया","I am fine, thank you","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["کیا حال ہے؟","kya haal hai?","क्या हाल है?","How are things?","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["سب خیریت ہے؟","sab khairiyat hai?","सब ख़ैरियत है? (सब कुशल है?)","Is all well?","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["آپ سے مل کر خوشی ہوئی","aap se mil kar khushi hui","आपसे मिलकर ख़ुशी हुई","Pleased to meet you","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["صبح بخیر","subah bakhair","सुबह बख़ैर (सुप्रभात)","Good morning","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["شب بخیر","shab bakhair","शब बख़ैर (शुभ रात्रि)","Good night","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["خدا حافظ","khuda hafiz","ख़ुदा हाफ़िज़ (अलविदा)","Goodbye (may God protect you)","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["پھر ملیں گے","phir milenge","फिर मिलेंगे","We will meet again","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["اپنا خیال رکھیے گا","apna khayal rakhiyega","अपना ख़याल रखिएगा","Please take care of yourself","/phrases/greetings/","p"],["میرا نام امن ہے","mera naam Aman hai","मेरा नाम अमन है","My name is Aman","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["آپ کا نام کیا ہے؟","aap ka naam kya hai?","आपका नाम क्या है?","What is your name?","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["آپ کا اسمِ شریف؟","aap ka ism-e-sharif?","आपका इस्म-ए-शरीफ़? (आपका शुभ नाम?)","May I know your good name? (very polite)","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میں ہندوستان سے ہوں","main Hindustan se hoon","मैं हिंदुस्तान से हूँ","I am from India","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["آپ کہاں سے ہیں؟","aap kahan se hain?","आप कहाँ से हैं?","Where are you from?","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میں لدھیانہ میں رہتا ہوں","main Ludhiana mein rehta hoon","मैं लुधियाना में रहता हूँ","I live in Ludhiana (said by a man)","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میں طالب علم ہوں","main talib-e-ilm hoon","मैं तालिब-ए-इल्म (विद्यार्थी) हूँ","I am a student","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میں دفتر میں کام کرتی ہوں","main daftar mein kaam karti hoon","मैं दफ़्तर में काम करती हूँ","I work in an office (said by a woman)","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["آپ کیا کرتے ہیں؟","aap kya karte hain?","आप क्या करते हैं?","What do you do?","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میری عمر بیس سال ہے","meri umr bees saal hai","मेरी उम्र बीस साल है","I am twenty years old","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["میں اردو سیکھ رہا ہوں","main Urdu seekh raha hoon","मैं उर्दू सीख रहा हूँ","I am learning Urdu","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["مجھے تھوڑی اردو آتی ہے","mujhe thodi Urdu aati hai","मुझे थोड़ी उर्दू आती है","I know a little Urdu","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["یہ میرے دوست ہیں","ye mere dost hain","ये मेरे दोस्त हैं","This is my friend (respectful)","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["آپ سے مل کر بہت اچھا لگا","aap se mil kar bahut achchha laga","आपसे मिलकर बहुत अच्छा लगा","It was very nice to meet you","/phrases/introductions/","p"],["شکریہ","shukriya","शुक्रिया (धन्यवाद)","Thank you","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["بہت بہت شکریہ","bahut bahut shukriya","बहुत-बहुत शुक्रिया","Thank you very much","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["مہربانی","meharbani","मेहरबानी (कृपा)","Kindness; thank you kindly","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["آپ کی نوازش ہے","aap ki nawazish hai","आपकी नवाज़िश है (आपकी कृपा है)","It is your kindness","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["معاف کیجیے","maaf kijiye","माफ़ कीजिए","Excuse me; forgive me","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["کوئی بات نہیں","koi baat nahin","कोई बात नहीं","It does not matter; you are welcome","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["جی ہاں","ji haan","जी हाँ","Yes (polite)","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["جی نہیں","ji nahin","जी नहीं","No (polite)","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["براہِ کرم","barah-e-karam","बराह-ए-करम (कृपया)","Please (formal)","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["ذرا سنیے","zara suniye","ज़रा सुनिए","Excuse me, please listen","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["تشریف لائیے","tashreef laiye","तशरीफ़ लाइए (पधारिए)","Please come in","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["تشریف رکھیے","tashreef rakhiye","तशरीफ़ रखिए (बैठिए)","Please be seated","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["اجازت دیجیے","ijazat dijiye","इजाज़त दीजिए (अब चलने दीजिए)","Please allow me to take leave","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["زحمت کے لیے معذرت","zahmat ke liye maazrat","ज़हमत के लिए माज़रत (तकलीफ़ के लिए क्षमा)","Sorry for the trouble","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["مبارک ہو","mubarak ho","मुबारक हो (बधाई हो)","Congratulations","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["آپ کا حکم","aap ka hukm","आपका हुक्म (जैसा आप कहें)","As you wish (literally, your command)","/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["مجھے بھوک لگی ہے","mujhe bhook lagi hai","मुझे भूख लगी है","I am hungry","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["مجھے پیاس لگی ہے","mujhe pyaas lagi hai","मुझे प्यास लगी है","I am thirsty","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["پانی دیجیے","paani dijiye","पानी दीजिए","Please give me water","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["کھانا تیار ہے","khaana tayyar hai","खाना तैयार है","The food is ready","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["دسترخوان لگا دیجیے","dastarkhwan laga dijiye","दस्तरख़्वान लगा दीजिए (खाना परोस दीजिए)","Please lay the table","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["نوش فرمائیے","nosh farmaiye","नोश फ़रमाइए (खाइए, बहुत आदर से)","Please eat (very polite)","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["کھانا بہت لذیذ ہے","khaana bahut lazeez hai","खाना बहुत लज़ीज़ (स्वादिष्ट) है","The food is delicious","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["چائے لیں گے؟","chai lenge?","चाय लेंगे?","Will you have tea?","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["ایک پیالی چائے","ek pyaali chai","एक प्याली चाय","A cup of tea","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["تھوڑا اور لیجیے","thoda aur lijiye","थोड़ा और लीजिए","Please have a little more","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["بس، شکریہ","bas, shukriya","बस, शुक्रिया","That is enough, thank you","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["نمک کم ہے","namak kam hai","नमक कम है","There is too little salt","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["مرچ زیادہ ہے","mirch zyada hai","मिर्च ज़्यादा है","It is too spicy","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["میں گوشت نہیں کھاتا","main gosht nahin khaata","मैं गोश्त (मांस) नहीं खाता","I do not eat meat (said by a man)","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["آپ نے بہت تکلّف کیا","aap ne bahut takalluf kiya","आपने बहुत तकल्लुफ़ किया (इतनी मेहमाननवाज़ी की ज़रूरत नहीं थी)","You have taken too much trouble for us","/phrases/food-and-home/","p"],["یہ کتنے کا ہے؟","ye kitne ka hai?","ये कितने का है?","How much is this?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["اس کی قیمت کیا ہے؟","is ki qeemat kya hai?","इसकी क़ीमत क्या है?","What is its price?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["بہت مہنگا ہے","bahut mehnga hai","बहुत महँगा है","It is very expensive","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["کچھ کم کیجیے","kuchh kam kijiye","कुछ कम कीजिए","Please reduce it a little","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["مجھے یہ چاہیے","mujhe ye chahiye","मुझे ये चाहिए","I want this","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["کوئی اور رنگ دکھائیے","koi aur rang dikhaiye","कोई और रंग दिखाइए","Please show me another colour","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["رسید دیجیے","raseed dijiye","रसीद दीजिए","Please give me a receipt","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["بازار کہاں ہے؟","bazaar kahan hai?","बाज़ार कहाँ है?","Where is the market?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["اسٹیشن کتنی دور ہے؟","station kitni door hai?","स्टेशन कितनी दूर है?","How far is the station?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["سیدھے جائیے","seedhe jaiye","सीधे जाइए","Go straight","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["دائیں مڑیے","daayen mudiye","दाएँ मुड़िए","Turn right","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["بائیں مڑیے","baayen mudiye","बाएँ मुड़िए","Turn left","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["یہاں روک دیجیے","yahan rok dijiye","यहाँ रोक दीजिए","Please stop here","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["کرایہ کتنا ہے؟","kiraya kitna hai?","किराया कितना है?","What is the fare?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["مجھے راستہ نہیں معلوم","mujhe raasta nahin maloom","मुझे रास्ता नहीं मालूम","I do not know the way","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["ٹکٹ کہاں ملے گا؟","ticket kahan milega?","टिकट कहाँ मिलेगा?","Where can I get a ticket?","/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["میں خوش ہوں","main khush hoon","मैं ख़ुश हूँ","I am happy","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["میں اداس ہوں","main udaas hoon","मैं उदास हूँ","I am sad","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے فکر ہے","mujhe fikr hai","मुझे फ़िक्र (चिंता) है","I am worried","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["میں تھک گیا ہوں","main thak gaya hoon","मैं थक गया हूँ","I am tired (said by a man)","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے ڈر لگ رہا ہے","mujhe dar lag raha hai","मुझे डर लग रहा है","I am afraid","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے غصہ آ رہا ہے","mujhe ghussa aa raha hai","मुझे ग़ुस्सा आ रहा है","I am getting angry","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے آپ پر فخر ہے","mujhe aap par fakhr hai","मुझे आप पर फ़ख़्र (गर्व) है","I am proud of you","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے افسوس ہے","mujhe afsos hai","मुझे अफ़सोस है","I am sorry; I regret it","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے آپ کی یاد آتی ہے","mujhe aap ki yaad aati hai","मुझे आपकी याद आती है","I miss you","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["مجھے تم سے محبت ہے","mujhe tum se mohabbat hai","मुझे तुमसे मोहब्बत है","I love you","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["یہ بہت خوبصورت ہے","ye bahut khoobsurat hai","ये बहुत ख़ूबसूरत है","This is very beautiful","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["کیا بات ہے!","kya baat hai!","क्या बात है!","How wonderful! (praise)","/phrases/feelings/","p"],["ماشاء اللہ","masha Allah","माशाअल्लाह (क्या ख़ूब; नज़र न लगे)","Said in admi